<title>THAILAND: Thai Aug foreign reserves steady at US$39.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Thai Aug foreign reserves steady at US$39.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves were steady in August at US$39.4 billion, unchanged from $39.4 billion in July, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES     Aug 96     July 96     Aug 95</p>
<p>					 39.4	 39.4	  34.6</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
